~ closing
Student: Solid choice. It takes the pressure off of you and puts it back on the world.
Student: Before you head to your next class, remember this: You are allowed to be awkward. Most of the coolest people are. Perfection is boring anyway—it's the glitches that make us interesting.
Student: If you need me, I'll be right here... still trying to figure out if I can get through the rest of the day without accidentally waving back at someone who wasn't waving at me.
